WEBVTT

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:07.820
It's summer.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.360
I want to die.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.910
Don't be so depressing, Tooru.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.820
Since it's summer, why don't we go to the beach?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.080
I don't want other people to see my skinny body.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.580
Gosh, don't worry so much!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.210
Everyone in the world is unique.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.380
You should take advantage of that!

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.510
Run-chan.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.340
Plus, people with certain fetishes...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.640
I didn't need the last part!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.350
Ta-dah!

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.320
That's why I bought a swimsuit for you, Tooru!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.990
I picked the smallest size, too.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.570
Let's go to the beach with this!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.070
Here!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.080
I'm sure it'll look good.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.870
Go on, try it on!

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.290
O-Okay.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:31.960
It looks great!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.800
But it's... a little... loose...

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.300
I'm coming in!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.760
I bought some ice cream!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.310
Er...

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.060
What's this?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.190
Tooru, she's got ice cream!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.810
I-I-I'm not hungry right now!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.190
Hey, what's wrong with Tooru?

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.360
Well, this and that...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.360
Ah, this is the new one they came out with this year!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.240
I always wanted to try it!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.240
That's why I decided to buy some.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.990
What a coincidence.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.790
Want to split it, then?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:08.910
Sure!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.670
On second thought, I'll have some!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.530
Wha...

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:18.550
Why are you naked?
Wha...

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.590
Why are you naked?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.810
Pool time!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.190
She changed fast!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.480
Goodness.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.650
Getting all worked up over the pool, even in high school.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.950
It must be blissful being Yutaka.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.120
What are you saying?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.120
When it comes to summer, it's gotta be the pool!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.290
Did you forget this is a class?

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.290
It's still the pool!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:50.910
Hm?

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.920
Toorun, your swimsuit is faded everywhere but here.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.130
Is it a hand-me-down?

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:02.260
This is... because I've been wearing this since elementary school.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.390
Ow!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.230
Gosh! That's dangerous!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.520
Floating feels so nice...

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.520
Yutaka, your breasts sure are big.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.780
They sure are.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:25.410
Hmph. All that fat floats, so it must make swimming easier.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.120
Backhanded compliment, huh? Jealous?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.540
O-Of course not- hm?

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.220
No fat at all!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.810
So hot!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.940
Gym is really harsh in the summertime.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.570
So the first-years have swimming class.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.070
Ah! It's Tooru!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.200
You're right! The pool sure looks refreshing.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.880
All right, gather 'round!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.840
Must be nice.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.550
I'm jealous.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.550
What's this, Nagi? I thought you hated the pool.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.720
I do hate the pool.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.770
Or rather, I don't want to wear a swimsuit.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.060
However!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.310
Toooruuu!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.650
Splash water on me! Buckets of water!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.820
Nagi's gone crazy from the heat!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.440
Stop it, Nagi!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.360
Well, whatever.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.990
Huh? The beach?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:56.040
Yep! Summer vacation starts next week, so let's all go!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.120
I'm in!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:05:59.630
Huh?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.170
I don't have any swimsuits I can wear at the beach.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.130
I don't want to wear one, period.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:09.090
What are you two saying? I'm sure that's not true!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.020
W-What?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.600
I'm sorry, did you hear that?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.940
Just because <i>she's got such a nice body...</i>

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.520
Just because she's so fair-skinned.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.610
Gosh, what are you saying?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.780
It's not about that!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.570
My, how modest.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.490
Geez...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.080
I'd rather go to the beach with everyone.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.830
Thank you very much!

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.750
All that walking's made me hot.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.090
Sorry for making you come with me.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.960
Nah, I bought some stuff too.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.420
Shall we take a break somewhere?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:48.970
Huh?

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.680
Nagi?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.560
What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.560
All the cold air's gathered here. It's nice!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.730
I'll take a break here.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:05.020
Wha-Nagi, stand up! Please!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.700
That girl back there was tall!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.740
She's probably over 170 centimeters.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.700
People must think I'm huge.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.330
Nah, I'm sure they're jealous.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.460
You're slender, and both your height and chest are impressive.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.040
The chest part was unnecessary.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.340
These give me a lot of problems, you know.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.550
Really?

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.300
These bras are nice!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.430
Plus they're cheap. Maybe I'll get one?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.390
You're right. I want one too!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.980
Hm? What is it?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.980
These only go up to size D.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.020
I guess being small can be convenient sometimes.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.530
Let's go home already.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.660
Hey, want to go take a look?

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.700
What now?

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.500
I thought we decided not to go to the beach.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.210
Oh come on, they're so cute!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.130
Well, I'm not buying anything.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.390
Nagi!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.480
How's this?

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:26.810
Looks fine.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.110
Really?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.070
I'm gonna try them on, so can you take a look?

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:30.610
Sure.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:33.780
How is it?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:34.990
Perfect.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:36.030
Really?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.030
In that case...

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.000
How about this one?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.580
Just right.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.870
In that case...

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.710
How about this?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.050
Like it was made for you.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.340
Really? It's so hard to decide!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.340
I'll go try some different ones.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.230
Just wait for a bit, 'kay?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.520
Sure.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.800
Okay!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.550
Nagi! Thanks for waiting!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.340
Huh?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.020
I-It's not what it looks like! I-I'm just...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.110
I was just taking a look...

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.740
I'll try some on.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.660
Right!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.450
And I bought one.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.910
It's fine! It looked great on you!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.080
Thanks.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.040
Oh yeah!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.710
Texting someone?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:14.000
Yep. Asking Run and Tooru if they want to go to the beach.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:14.880
What?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.180
I can't wait!

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.890
<i>Just two more kilograms.</i>

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.060
<i>Not happening, is it?</i>

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.980
Run says okay!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.110
I'm home.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.440
Welcome back!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.610
Run-chan was just here.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.490
Did she already leave?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.910
Yeah. She just had something to give you.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.680
This is a swimsuit I used to wear.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.640
I think it'll fit you perfectly!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:23.120
Let's race to that island, Tooru...

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.960
Play hard, learn hard,

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:35.250
and I look forward to seeing you all full of energy at the start of the next semester.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.180
Wait up!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:14.420
Ocean! Ocean! Ocean! Ocean! Ocean!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.710
What are you, a kid?

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:22.880
The ocean!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:23.630
Ocean!

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.300
Huh?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.100
It's so pretty!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.820
We're in the middle of the road.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.190
Streetcar mode, I guess.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.650
You're right.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.990
Wow! It goes on the road!

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.240
I wonder when they attached them?

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.410
Huh? Attached what?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.040
The tires, of course!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.040
There aren't any.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.880
Yahoo!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.180
We're here!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.980
The beach!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.770
All right! Time to swim!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.980
Being at the beach always gets my spirits up!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.610
Me too!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.230
Run-chan.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.490
Thanks for lending me your swimsuit.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.450
No problem! I'm glad it fits.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.870
Sorry the design's sort of childish.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.080
It's fine.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.250
After all,

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.120
it's from when I was in elementary school!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.630
Hey!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.500
What are you doing? Let's hurry up and go!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.710
Coming!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.800
<i>Elementary school...</i>

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.480
Take that!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.440
You got me!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:03.780
Yah!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.910
Gosh, that tickles!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.290
And up you go!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.800
What gives?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.510
That looks like fun, Tooru!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.760
Let go... of me...

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.640
Tooru? Nagi?

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.110
Look at your head!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:47.990
What?

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:48.950
Seaweed.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.860
Huh?

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:52.450
Ugh!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.280
It looks good on you, Nagi!

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.410
Looks good!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.120
Seaweed...

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.300
Let me have a time-out.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.760
Aw, come on, Nagi, tired already?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.600
I woke up at 5 AM!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.310
I'm running out of steam here.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.350
I'm still doing fine!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.270
Well, I'm a weakling.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.100
Then let's take a breather.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.860
I'll go buy some juice!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.980
Ah, then get me a melon soda, please.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.300
Sure thing.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.360
Sports drink for me.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.700
Okay!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.450
She really must have been tired.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.580
Welcome!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.250
There's a lot of choices.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.790
Which should I get?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.010
Run-chan. That one.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.680
I never imagined that here, of all places,

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.440
I would encounter the legendary amber candy juice!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.520
Uh-huh.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.020
Nagi-chan! We're back.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.400
Hey.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.820
Huh?

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.940
Yuuko's sleeping.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.450
She really is.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.410
Honestly,

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:16.120
she was all, "I'm still doing fine!" a minute ago,

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.910
but as soon as she sits down, this happens.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.080
She looks comfortable.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.370
I know!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.330
Hm?

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.510
This feels wonderful!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.310
There are no crowds, plus it's quiet.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.890
You can't beat a tropical island.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.480
W-What's this?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:52.650
Leaves.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.160
Gosh, what's the big idea, Tooru?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.580
It tickles!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.710
Y-You're heavy...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.760
Y-You're all heavy!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.550
Huh?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.010
A-A dream?

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.640
I must have fallen asleep.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.230
A-A castle?!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.320
Get it off!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.820
Don't move.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.620
We're almost done.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.660
Get this off me already!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:43.870
Take that!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.000
Attack!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:49.960
Here!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:53.670
Sorry.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.010
Don't sweat it!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.100
What's up?

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.110
It feels like it's tugging at you. It's so much fun!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.910
Is it really that fun?

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.630
Nagi?

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.890
M-Me too!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.440
Lunch time!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.900
When you go to the beach, you gotta have ramen!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.200
Fried noodles.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.320
Taco-rice, a real tropical dish!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.910
I brought a bento.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.410
Same as usual, huh?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:05.950
Really?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.160
Don't worry! Leave it to me!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.870
Huh? What are you going to do?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.420
Well, we're at the ocean, after all!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.090
Fish!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.360
The people are thinning out.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.660
Well, it's evening already.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.240
Feels like we played a ton today.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.910
It was worth coming early.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.250
Right?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.170
The beach was lots of fun!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.290
Yeah!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:36.670
Well,

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.630
I guess it was fun.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:40.670
Let's come again together some time!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.380
Yeah.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.930
Yuuko, hurry up!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.720
Hang on a second!

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.600
Hurry, hurry!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.230
It's all empty.
We made it.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.940
It's all empty.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.360
Yuuko-chan, you're not going to sit?

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.620
Ah, no, I'm fine right here.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.870
We won't arrive home for a while.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:13.370
Well, I still have energy left...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.630
Is it all right, Yuuko?

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.970
Yeah, it looks fine.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.130
Cuticles!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:25.930
Huh?

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.800
Are your cuticles all right, Yuuko-chan?

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.100
How do you expect her to tell?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.850
I-I think they're all right.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.980
Yuuko-chan, your hair is long and pretty,

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.560
so you gotta take care of it!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.770
Her skin's white, too.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.190
Th-Thanks...

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:43.150
Oh yeah, I wonder if I got tanned?

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.150
I'm sure you don't have to worry.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.160
You put on sunscreen and all.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.160
I guess.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.070
What about you, Run?

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.080
She's not tanned at all.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.540
Run, what kind of sunscreen do you use?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.290
Don't use any.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.710
How'd you keep your skin like this without sunscreen?

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.420
I can't believe it.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.300
That tickles!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:11.470
I'm the type that doesn't tan easily.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.140
Really?

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.720
What are you, an alien?

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.100
What? No, I'm not!

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.810
Run-chan is an Earthling.

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:19.980
Are you sure?

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.270
I'm sure!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.910
I wonder why swimming makes you so sleepy?

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.790
Especially during lunchtime after swimming class!

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:05.040
This must be the fearful beginning.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:05.790
What's that mean?

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.630
If you fall asleep at lunchtime, then you won't be sleepy that night,

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:12.180
but if you don't fall asleep at night, next lunchtime you'll be sleepy...

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:13.800
Ah, that happens, doesn't it?

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.300
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:16.810
"A Midsummer Night's..."!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:21.100
When that happens, you just have to sleep from noon till the next morning to fix it!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:22.690
How much do you plan to sleep?
